{{!-- Customer opened a warranty claim. Data: orderNumber, productName, reasonLabel, viewUrl --}}
{{> heading text="We got your report"}}
{{#> para}}Thanks for letting us know about your <strong>{{productName}}</strong> key from order <strong>{{orderNumber}}</strong>.{{/para}}

{{> details rows=detailRows}}

{{#> callout tone="info"}}We'll check the key and, if it's covered, send you a replacement by email, usually within 24 hours. You don't need to do anything else.{{/callout}}

{{> button url=viewUrl label="View your order"}}

{{#> para small=true}}Anything to add? Just reply to this email.{{/para}}
